@startuml
title Component Diagram - System Architecture

' Aceasta diagrama arata arhitectura de componente a sistemului SophiaTech Eats.

package "Presentation Layer" {
  [HTTP Handlers (API)] as handlers
  note right of handlers : OrderApiHandler\nCatalogApiHandler
}

package "Business Logic Layer" {
  [OrderService] as orderSvc
  [CatalogService] as catalogSvc
  [CartService] as cartSvc
}

package "Data Access Layer (Repository)" {
  [OrderRepository] as orderRepo
  [RestaurantRepository] as restRepo
  [DeliveryCatalogRepository] as deliveryRepo
}

package "Domain Layer" {
  [Core Entities] as domain
  note bottom of domain : Order, Cart, Restaurant,\nCampusUser, DeliverySlot
}

' Relationships
handlers --> orderSvc : uses
handlers --> catalogSvc : uses
handlers --> cartSvc : uses

orderSvc --> orderRepo : reads/writes
orderSvc --> deliveryRepo : reads/writes
orderSvc --> restRepo : reads

catalogSvc --> restRepo : reads/writes
catalogSvc --> deliveryRepo : reads/writes

cartSvc --> domain : manipulates

orderRepo ..> domain : stores
restRepo ..> domain : stores
deliveryRepo ..> domain : stores

orderSvc ..> domain : business rules
catalogSvc ..> domain : business rules

@enduml
